###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/credit-cards/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardId": "1a1a1a1a-1a1a-1a1a-1a1a-1a1a1a1a1a1a",
  "amount": 150,
  "description": "Coffee",
  "purchaseDate": "2026-08-06T09:00:00Z"
}

###

